public class Main {
  static int discount(int price, int rate){if(price<0||rate<0||rate>100)throw new IllegalArgumentException();return price-price*rate/100;}
  public static void main(String[] args){if(discount(1000,20)!=800)throw new AssertionError();System.out.println("OK");}
}

quiz.question:
次のメソッドを単体テストしにくくしている点はどれでしょう。

```java
static int fee(int price) {
    int rate = LocalDate.now().getDayOfWeek() == DayOfWeek.SUNDAY ? 20 : 10;
    return price * rate / 100;
}
```

